ent, sunshine, etc.). It's time we honor our ancestors by putting back in, what the modern world has left out (to return our people back to strength, health and happiness). We walk our talk and we offer a one-of-a-kind \"guided\" experience. Learn more at www.ancestralsupplements.com\nBrian Johnson\n\"Liver King\""},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Pasture-raised in New Zealand & Australia\r\nGrass-fed & grass-finished"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Living Collagen 500 mg ea"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Hormone, pesticide & GMO free\nAbsolutely no fillers (or) flow agents"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use:\n6 capsules daily or as directed by a healthcare professional"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"One small batch at a time"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2022-10-24","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":306109,"description":"","notes":"grassfed","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":6,"operator":"=","quantity":3000,"unit":"mg","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":null,"percent":null,"footnote":"Daily Value not established"}],"servingSizeUnit":"Capsule(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":2,"ingredientId":264000,"description":null,"notes":"","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQua